# Ovika, Enigma Goliath: "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, create X 1/1 red Phyrexian Goblin creature tokens, where X is the
# mana value of that spell. They gain haste until end of turn." Bot1 casts Ovika on turn 1 off two Black Lotuses and a Mountain, then a
# third Black Lotus - a noncreature spell with mana value 0 - which makes no Goblins. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Fireball with X = 2 (mana
# value 3, the announced X counting, CR 202.3e): three Goblins appear with haste, so they attack at once beside Ovika (CR 611.2c): 2 from
# Fireball + 3 + 6 takes Bot2 from 20 to 9. The next turn the Goblins have lost the haste.

